uest guarantee for `maxContextTokens`, and a configuration that relies on this line can send a request above that ceiling.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-that crosses the ceiling has already been sent; use `strictTokenBudget` for a\n-pre-request guarantee. Either stop settles `stopReason: 'budget'` and appends\n+that crosses the ceiling has already been sent. No pre-request guarantee\n+exists for `maxContextTokens`; `strictTokenBudget` bounds `maxInputTokens`\n+and `reserveOutputTokens` instead. Either stop settles `stopReason: 'budget'`\n+and appends\n```\n\n</details>","id":"6a1cf3944095295c65feef9fe8515d171c88d6c40b9feea1bae6ac282b341acf","intervals":[[79,80]],"path":"src/driver/README.md","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Correct the `maxContextTokens` pre-request guarantee in the README."}],"head":"ef972cc65350ad256bd26d485659bfc2b6fe80f7","head_tree":"7e3bc6040d8da1acb2564424b853efe795537180","input_scope":[{"blob":"73ac80f58155ac1eb909ac1bd63fefc2660f12d9","intervals":[[1,592]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"}],"job_id":"3557073740ddf56c1e9fe2c6b4bbcd96d1b64bffddf6d945e803afe551f622da:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"residual uncovered lines"},"blob":"73ac80f58155ac1eb909ac1bd63fefc2660f12d9","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/driver/README.md","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"73ac80f58155ac1eb909ac1bd63fefc2660f12d9","intervals":[[93,94],[392,392],[410,410],[530,530]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"73ac80f58155ac1eb909ac1bd63fefc2660f12d9","intervals":[[93,94],[392,392],[410,410],[530,530]],"path":"src/driver/README.md"}],"scope_digest":"db7715e64bb12a8822acde400b8d39a3dad9c1cb22786fade9504b88cb489dea","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-3557073740ddf56c1